            "label": "Drained 1"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " as the plants feed off your life force. This condition lasts until you spend 3 consecutive actions to rest and do nothing."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Moderate Backlash",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You become "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "fa3d4a94-c2f9-519b-b0a3-82d2612e188b",
