            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "5e3582c3-701c-5169-9c69-4221096722c2"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " until you spend 20 minutes recuperating by resting and doing nothing. If you spend this time basking in sunshine, it instead takes 10 minutes."
          }
        ]
      },
