            "type": "text",
            "text": " You become "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "fa3d4a94-c2f9-519b-b0a3-82d2612e188b",
            "label": "Drained 3"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " until you spend 2 hours napping. While napping, you're "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "e1a78dad-4887-518e-9120-e58b7009ebfd"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and can't take actions or engage in exploration activities, but a creature can wake you with a single action with the manipulate trait. If you spend this time napping in natural sunlight, it instead takes 1 hour. You're fatigued until you can get a full night's rest."
          }
        ]
